{"lyrics":"[Intro]\n[00:03.60] G-Money just bought a pound of the Gushers, we've been smokin' exotic product (Countin' this cash until I have an out of body)\n[00:09.50] G-Money just bought a pound of the Gushers, we've been smokin' exotic product (Countin' this cash until I have an out of body)\n[00:17.22] Modern-day rockstar, I feel like Ozzy, honestly (Okay)\n[00:18.76] G-Money just bought a pound of the Gushers, we've been smokin', yeah\n[Chorus]\n[00:21.80] G-Money just bought a pound of the Gushers, we've been smokin' exotic product (Woah, woah, woah, woah, slatt, slatt)\n[00:25.40] Was robbin' and juggin' with roadrunners, every day whippin', keeping the stove jumpin' (Exotic product)\n[00:28.32] I just went and found me some Actavis, I've been havin' an out of body\n[00:30.70] I grew up sippin' green, I was on one, I remember the first day the purple comin' (Yeah, yeah, yeah, yeah, yeah, out of body)\n[Verse 1]\n[00:34.00] I get so high I panic, off of the medi—cine need a medic, medic (Yeah, yeah, yeah, yeah, yeah)\n[00:37.06] These hoes, I'm not entertainin', fuck up my sanity\n[00:39.38] I'm too busy counting the fetty (Yeah, yeah, yeah, yeah, yeah)\n[00:41.04] We keep them guns on us, you know we war-ready\n[00:42.90] My gun sing like Mariah, so I love to Carey it\n[00:45.26] If he talk out his neck, then his momma gon' bury 'em\n[00:47.12] If this bitch is a keeper, I'll take her then marry her\n[00:49.20] Fuck her friends in a Tahoe, the more is the merrier\n[00:51.24] There was Susie, and Anna, and Lisa, and Mary, or somethin'\n[00:54.00] I think her name Mary or somethin'?\n[00:55.42] But I couldn't tell if, you know I be high as a dummy\n[00:57.98] I don't take these Perky's for nothin'\n[00:59.42] Get so high it's embarrassin', that I don't be rememberin' names\n[01:02.34] But it's okay, don't matter how you play as long as you play the game (Let's go)\n[Chorus]\n[01:06.18] G-Money just bought a pound of the Gushers, we've been smokin' exotic product (Exotic product)\n[01:10.60] Was robbin' and juggin' with roadrunners, every day whippin', keeping the stove jumpin'\n[01:14.74] I just went and found me some Actavis, I've been havin' an out of body (Out of body)\n[01:18.78] I grew up sippin' green, I was on one, I remember the first day the purple comin'\n[Verse 2]\n[01:21.18] Talkin' that lean talk, yeah (Talkin' that talk)\n[01:22.14] Talkin' that lean talk, yeah (Talkin' that talk)\n[01:27.06] Talkin' that Perc talk, yeah (Kel-Tec chat)\n[01:29.80] Talkin' that bean talk, yeah (Kel-Tec talk)\n[01:31.18] Talkin' 'bout the scope on the rifle (Talk)\n[01:33.22] Choppa with a beam on, yeah (Kel-Tec talk)\n[01:35.28] Talkin' 'bout the bitch with a fat ol' ass (Talk) finna let 'em get up on it (Talk)\n[01:39.56] I'm livin' life like I'm Makaveli, wanna kill me then I got the MAC-11 (Slatt)\n[01:43.74] I got a bitch with her own money, and my bank got more green than a Packer's player (Slatt, slatt, slatt)\n[01:48.10] I'm livin' life like a cowboy with this Glizzy on me, no revolv' (Yeah, yeah, yeah, yeah, yeah)\n[01:51.54] I'm not ordinary, I can't go in the mall\n[01:53.36] Barney's private shoppin', one call (Uh-huh)\n[01:56.04] Phone call for my bros\n[01:58.00] They really miss me back home (Uh-huh)\n[01:59.80] All the hoes want dick from back home (Uh-huh)\n[02:01.98] They wasn't tryna fuck me when I was broke (Uh-huh)\n[02:04.16] Now they want me to make time for 'em (Uh-huh)\n[02:06.00] Half of me sayin', \"Fuck it, give 'em consent forms\" (Uh-huh)\n[02:08.08] My main girl like a 911 new Porsche\n[02:09.82] And I ain't tryna smoke that one, no Newport\n[Chorus]\n[02:12.42] G-Money just bought a pound of the Gushers, we've been smokin' exotic product (Exotic product)\n[02:16.40] Was robbin' and juggin' with roadrunners, every day whippin', keeping the stove jumpin'\n[02:20.78] I just went and found me some Actavis, I've been havin' an out of body (Outer body)\n[02:24.76] I grew up sippin' green, I was on on